-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Even as Mikoto and Kuroko question Dr. Kiyami about the side-effects of Level Uppers, Saten wonders if she should use the one she recently found - even though there could be dangerous consequences.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-11-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":6.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8op5Y340tMs3ohR4qwK585hH2kR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8op5Y340tMs3ohR4qwK585hH2kR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30977/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"749395","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Saten falls into a coma after she confesses using a Level Upper to Uiharu. Later, Mikoto and Kuroko discover that all of the recent coma patients are connected - in more ways than one!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-12-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":6.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oCOxiJhnvKiAN5oaBD5WAc0sGHT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oCOxiJhnvKiAN5oaBD5WAc0sGHT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30977/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"749408","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After inadvertently connecting to Kiyama’s mind, Mikoto learns what’s been motivating the doctor’s actions. Later, when the network goes out of control, Mikoto comes face to face with a monster!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-12-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":6.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mP0rgcql3gLdptgry6wMJfhHbWk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mP0rgcql3gLdptgry6wMJfhHbWk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30977/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"749405